{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d54140f0617fdc0f1f9b5046f98f089b3e8d59e615c3d1f5352f97629ef93d31", "ja": "『アイドルヒーローズ　ジェネシス』の撮影も\nいよいよ佳境だな。真、調子はどうだ？", "zh": "《偶像英雄联盟Genesis》的拍摄\n也终于到了高潮部分呢。真，你的状况如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "2cbb210d5f8a390e679f0a898982efba702a5f89442896fbc576c56859bac7ea", "ja": "へへっ、バッチリですよ、{$P$}！\n泣いても笑っても、今日がボクの撮影最終日。", "zh": "嘿嘿，好极了呢，{$P$}！\n不管是哭是笑，今天都是在下最后一次入镜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "9da5f2f90868e704a4949c50cf2e00c4e63d037b9c99e9897a26c897b9496e8e", "ja": "最後までガンガン突っ走って、『マコト』役を\n演じきってみせますよ！　くぅ～っ、燃えてきた～っ！", "zh": "在下要全力冲刺到最后，完美诠释\n『真』这个角色！哦～！在下开始热血沸腾了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a48cce35b3a3c7bc01865ca00a20a47f1165123755a65443ebf02a7f80b3a694", "ja": "おお、気合い十分だな！　でも、マコトってそんな\n熱血キャラじゃないから、ちょっと抑えたほうが……。", "zh": "喔喔，很有干劲嘛！但电影中的真不是那种热血角色，\n你还是收敛一点比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "92c8bea9c50f6b6ef915d4cbf57a7632b45ba5042c4237574ae8cc3f10114e3d", "ja": "あ。沈着冷静な敵幹部、マコトの役作りに\n影響が出るんじゃないかって、心配なんですね？", "zh": "啊，电影中的真是冷静沉着的反派干部，\n你是担心在下太激动，导致无法融入角色吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "8ba41d042d8bfed97eebbfc61c838874daeff79fa714ad8d7ab355d1674b14f8", "ja": "大丈夫です！　そうならないように\nいつでもクールに徹する特訓法も編み出しました！", "zh": "不用怕！为了避免这种事情发生，\n在下也想好了随时都能变得冷酷无情的特训方法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1006_p", "source_sha256": "499d680e80bdc3ac764124c6f7e624ef1bfa3dc23079bd5ef7466c91f54fc8c8", "ja": "特訓法？　へえ、それはすごいな。\nどんな方法なんだ？", "zh": "特训方法？哦，那还真了不起呢。\n请问是什么方法啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "8e12ec28dcb256c6faa9ea18c73ebab2da35f2d575739eba420c80a76cbe78d9", "ja": "ふっふっふ……、知りたいですか？\nそれは……ズバリ、子猫の動画です！", "zh": "呵呵呵……想知道吗？\n方法就是……看小猫的影片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7b62c0bd042609ee7b17260dce1cba728156bf770f9920b81a67df4a0ca96cc3", "ja": "……えっ？　子猫の動画？", "zh": "……什么？小猫的影片？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "21dfcb58e2844031e65b1807bc542bcc11b5b21a2b5bcc5f3cbbb2441ad4e371", "ja": "はい！　子猫って、すっごくカワイイですよね？\n見てるとついニヤニヤしちゃって……えへへ。", "zh": "没错！小猫超可爱的吧？\n看着看着就会让人不自觉地嘴角上扬……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "ae9589d62b82221aad8d0fa89e38a39b49bc277323433ac7b6a4fd4bb8bf7a3f", "ja": "でも、マコトになりきるには感情を殺さないと\nいけない！　だからあえて、子猫の動画を見るんです。", "zh": "但是，要诠释好真就必须扼杀自己的情感！\n所以才要反其道而行，多看小猫的影片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "0c27baae25da1afacda37a26dab923f8da4456545713c47885858be73774072a", "ja": "カワイイ～！　って思っても、絶対顔に出さない。\n無表情のままでいる訓練なんです！", "zh": "就算心里觉得「好可爱～！」也绝对不能表现在脸上。\n这是在训练自己的扑克脸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b152073bdbf0ce4d352b101b6088140b0bdad6dac6669f407b45fe11766d4282", "ja": "なるほど、ある種の自己暗示みたいなものか。\n理にかなってはいる……のかな？", "zh": "原来如此，类似某种自我催眠啊。\n听起来也算合理……大概吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "893da78b520b1191168c314e67f22b05a42047992d96708d3e2460fc3e757110", "ja": "結構、効果あるんですよ、これ！\nまだ時間があるから、やってみますね！", "zh": "不骗你，这招其实满有效的喔！\n现在还有点时间，在下做给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "c82298b6e88f44c8a69801c39195fa41148f1b34879390fcf56b5995ef563b2a", "ja": "じゃあ、動画再生、っと。……ん……。\n…………。……………。", "zh": "那就来播放影片……嗯……\n………………………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c8dd07b4de0e6b56a70ef9b7bc780bf44c052ed0bbf446249d210cac45820311", "ja": "（……おお、すごい集中力だ！　感情表現が豊かな真が\n子猫の動画を見ても無表情を貫いている……）", "zh": "（……喔喔，真是惊人的专注力！情感表现那么丰富的真\n居然能一直面无表情地看着小猫的影片……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6cbbd696507c898b32a622d83710dd442ef8404082f7f558d9a693a0daae486d", "ja": "ところで、どんな動画なんだ？\nちょっと俺にも、見せて……。", "zh": "话说回来，影片的内容是什么啊？\n让我也看一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "cf019dd0358a947166956a2cbb4f12330032c9b949367dd8ab42617233986aa7", "ja": "えっ……わ、わあっ！", "zh": "咦……哇、哇啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cf834ea4ba608e9c42dd49e6821aa032fa66776cb81102146802ff438ffe2dda", "ja": "ん？　どうした、真？", "zh": "嗯？你怎么了，真？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "3e8e1651363f033682767f0ff324fda6573e618430c138548c5ec7d7f5991fae", "ja": "だ、だって！　……急に近くに、\n{$P$}の、顔が……。", "zh": "因、因为！……谁叫\n{$P$}的脸，突然靠得这么近……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6da0f39a3d66be814fd7c6239658eaedd5e8381e2b6a0d10f3db0acfbb5e579c", "ja": "ん？　顔が真っ赤だぞ、真。\nそれはさすがに無表情じゃないような……。", "zh": "嗯？你的脸很红喔，真。\n这样不算成功摆出扑克脸吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "e5520aa7096a0064ea59a0ea897be1241ec4cc233a77687490adec450365478f", "ja": "うえぇ！　ち、違います！　ここ、これは、その……。\nた、たまたま調子が悪かっただけで！", "zh": "呜呜！不、不是的！这这、这是因为……\n在下正好状况不佳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1022_staff", "source_sha256": "12622c5c7115a26e190ab44730391c9d8a98ad1037a5b7d14e2dc0043d86f74a", "ja": "菊地真さ～ん！　スタンバイ、お願いします！", "zh": "菊地真小姐～！差不多该准备上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "6e7b27fcdf8cb1826ec07a6d1fbe3d620129ee9673f36a54fa42ce5548a2e671", "ja": "ああ、スタッフさんに呼ばれちゃった……。\n特訓もまだ途中だけど……うう！", "zh": "唉，工作人员来叫在下了……\n特训才进行到一半而已……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1024_p", "source_sha256": "fedc925fce56544ee0b812e2a395659ec2496a2ef48c7f8c65eceb6dca2399cf", "ja": "ご、ごめんな。本番前なのに、俺がどんな特訓か\n知りたいなんて言ったから……。", "zh": "抱、抱歉啊，都快正式上场了，\n我还问你特训的内容，打扰到你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "a2282a9127817595cd34a0db0021dbba4de25f8b5899a5c45f529245a4881866", "ja": "い、いえ。ちょっと嬉しかった……あああ、\nじゃなくてっ！　こういう時にこそ、特訓の成果を！", "zh": "没、没关系，而且在下也有点开心……啊啊啊，\n不是啦！这种时候更该展现特训的成果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "3ab1e072b64bb4fb9a62dd471397f0632d9c3b428b712dc6cf8d1baf0c39215a", "ja": "……ボクは、冷酷非道な『ネメシス』幹部のマコト。\n感情を殺して、クールに、クールに…………。", "zh": "……在下是『Nemesis』冷酷无情的干部，真。\n要扼杀情感，冷静、沉着…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "4143c5662fb7511bfe70f9f067c8e739c254b889d6d80db38c7d864c55336645", "ja": "……。……よし、大丈夫です！　それじゃあ\n{$P$}、行ってきますっ！！", "zh": "…………好，没问题了！\n那么{$P$}，在下要上场了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3328f4416f1a7516a2472cdbd990cd24756dc62d456228a4d3837da02ce11bff", "ja": "お、おう……行ってらっしゃい。\n怪我には気をつけるんだぞ。", "zh": "好、好的……你去吧。\n当心别受伤喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0094_1029_p", "source_sha256": "63ea0a5104cb6028992fccd0d31ae4d74928a1c7666379fc1e2859663ebc0398", "ja": "（その後の撮影は、真のクールな演技が炸裂。\n無事に迫力のある戦闘シーンを撮ることができた！）", "zh": "（在之后的拍摄中，真完美展现出帅气的演技，\n顺利拍完了气势磅礡的战斗场景！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
